The Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi, met the Vice President, Thiru C. P. Radhakrishnan Ji, at Uprashtrapati Bhawan today and exchanged Diwali greetings.
In a post on X, Shri Modi wrote;
“Met Vice President Thiru CP Radhakrishnan Ji and exchanged Diwali greetings.
@VPIndia
@CPR_VP”
Met Vice President Thiru CP Radhakrishnan Ji and exchanged Diwali greetings.

